    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This dataset includes reprocessed magnetic line data from the ICECAP program, for data flown in seasons 2008/2009 to 2012/2013 (ICECAP-I) and in seasons 2015/2016 and 2016/2017 (ICECAP-II).  Processing steps are described in included README file. Data were reprocessed to correct temporo-spatial variations in magnetic field intensity and to account for differences in flight elevation and subglacial topography.",
